git status --short
```

Also run:

```text
SQLite test suite
PostgreSQL integration suite
full optional dependency suite
package clean-install test
release gate
```

Run available:

```bash
ruff check .
black --check .
mypy .
```

Report every failure.

---

# 99. DEFINITION OF DONE

Upgrade-08 is complete only when:

* [ ] SQLite remains functional local mode
* [ ] PostgreSQL backend exists
* [ ] schema migrations exist
* [ ] PostgreSQL claims are atomic
* [ ] stale workers are blocked by fencing tokens
* [ ] leases survive multi-process/multi-host coordination
* [ ] workers are centrally registered
* [ ] scheduler uses worker capabilities
* [ ] outbox prevents lost external mutations
* [ ] webhook dedupe is database-enforced
* [ ] GitHub App auth uses installation identity correctly
* [ ] installation tokens are not persistently stored
* [ ] multi-installation routing works
* [ ] repositories must be explicitly enabled
* [ ] GitHub permissions are least-privilege
* [ ] workflow-file mutations receive stronger policy
* [ ] horizontal webhook/API processes are safe
* [ ] multi-repository concurrency is bounded
* [ ] operations API uses shared services
* [ ] Web console contains no orchestration business logic
* [ ] tenant/scope isolation has negative tests
* [ ] worker crash recovery passes
* [ ] control-plane crash recovery passes
* [ ] DB restart behavior is tested
* [ ] default CI requires no real GitHub/Anthropic credentials
* [ ] PostgreSQL integration CI executes automatically
* [ ] release gate covers distributed-control-plane guarantees
* [ ] no P0/P1 correctness/security defect remains

